<title>HONG KONG: Jackin named distributor for Sony.</title>
<headline>Jackin named distributor for Sony.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jackin International Holdings Ltd said on Thursday it was appointed the authorised distributor for data media products under the &quot;Sony&quot; brand designed and made for Sony Corp of Hong Kong Ltd, a unit of Sony Corp.</p>
<p>Jackin is engaged in the original equipment manufacturing of brandname video cassettes and optical media products.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
